    newest-to-oldest direction ([38;5;153mdesc[39m).
  - [1mEmpty snapshot with no filter:[0m it says "No deploys", so the page never shows "No deploys in " with nothing after it.
  - [1mSame-service rows:[0m they are put newest first before the table sorts, so sorting by Service keeps each service's
    deploys in time order.
  - [1mLong deploys:[0m durations always read "Xm Ys", including "0m 45s" and "75m 0s" (no hours).

